  "description": "DotTorch Losses is the dedicated .NET 8/9 library providing a comprehensive set of loss functions for deep learning and machine learning tasks. This package integrates seamlessly with DotTorch.Core, enabling robust automatic differentiation and efficient tensor operations. The initial 9.0.0 release introduces key loss primitives such as MSE, Cross-Entropy, Binary Cross-Entropy, Huber, KL Divergence, NLL, and Hinge Loss with full support for broadcasting and reduction options.",
